          "id": "c3ed13feea356ac0523f7e79a905605d105c6fe4",
          "message": "Harden HTTP/3 connection admission [GPT-5.6] (#2229)\n\nKeep serve_h3 backward compatible while applying safe default global and per-IP connection caps, with an additive custom-limits entry point and a bounded Quinn receive window.\n\nMutation witness: replacing the global semaphore cap made the excess-connection queue test fail, and bypassing the per-IP counter made the refusal test fail.\n\nCo-authored-by: GPT-5.6 <noreply@openai.com>",
