          "message": "Expose TextIndex term statistics [GPT-5.6] (#2233)\n\nAdd TermStats and an analyzer-aware exact-token accessor backed by the same BM25 IDF helper used by search and fuzzy scoring. Document the public API in the full-text usage skill.\n\nNon-vacuity verified: changing the pinned fox document count from 2 to 3 makes the focused integration test fail.\n\nCo-authored-by: GPT-5.6 <noreply@openai.com>",
