          "message": "feat(arrow): add schema-only variable readers [GPT-5.6] (#2245)\n\nFactor SELECT-variable reconstruction and schema validation into one private helper shared by RecordBatch, IPC, and Parquet imports. Expose feature-gated schema-only readers for IPC and Parquet bytes, with non-empty and empty-result coverage.\n\nNon-vacuity verified: changing each value-pinned expected variable name made its focused IPC/Parquet test fail before the assertions were restored.\n\nCo-authored-by: GPT-5.6 <noreply@openai.com>",
